 1st person POV<br />FMC: Amelie<br />MMC: Sante<br /><br />I really enjoyed this story! Amelie and Sante met at her sisters wedding 4 years prior to the story beginning. They are both young and damaged. He feels something for her but is sent to Sicily for 4 years. Upon his return he ends up stalking Amelie. She is a ballerina and he watches her dance. He moves in next door to her. She doesn't recognize him because of how much he has changed in the past 4 years. He is obsessive and completely committed to her once he sees her again. There is some deception and groveling on his part. Their story is 4 years in the making. <br /><br />I took off one star--and this is a ME thing. I prefer that my MMCs are celibate after meeting the FMC. Some people consider it safe as long as they haven't been together yet. My personal preference is that they are celibate after meeting especially if the MMC already declares that they have any type of feelings. His conquests during the separation aren't rubbed in the readers face, which I appreciated--but the fact that he was not celibate is mentioned. I'm not sure if being with women was part of his "training", but regardless-- it's a me thing. If I missed anything and I am wrong about this--someone please clarify--but this is what I gathered from the information provided. <br /><br />Safety:<br />OW/OM drama: None<br />Cheating: None<br />3rd act breakup:No<br />Celibate: Yes and no. He didn't seem to be celibate after they first met during their 4 year separation because he mentioned that if there's one thing italian women knew, it's sx. She made it seem like she had dated men but didn't sleep with any of them. After he returned they weren't with other people.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"