ith obsessed, stalkerish, morally grey hero and lovely ballerina heroine who is so strong despite all the sufferings, then this book is for you. <br /><br />Sante and Amelie meets one night and they bond over the hidden pain and past trauma. That makes a lasting impression on Sante so when he can’t forget her even after 4 years, he decides to see her once more. This time from the shadows. Man, wasn’t that the best decision of both their life. <br />I loved how protective and obsessed he was. Meanwhile Amelie gave him the peace and courage to face his own demons. <br />There was a twist I never saw coming and I was happy to know what ‘really’ happened between Sante and Amelie on Oran’s wedding.<br /><br />So glad to see the gang Oran, Lina, Noemi, Conner and their beautiful kids.<br />I am so stoked to read Tommy’s book and that ending was everything. <br /><br />Safety: It’s not mentioned but from what I understood Sante wasn’t celibate during that 4 years. That kinda bothered me because of how obsessed he was of her. Amelie too had short relationships. <br /><br />-Stalker romance. <br />-Obsessed hero x ballerina heroine. <br />-Anti hero.<br />-KU, TW could be read as a standalone.<br />-Recommend. <br /><br />I received an advance review copy and I’m leaving this review voluntarily.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">10 likes</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__