cbr /\u003eI had no idea which direction this book was taking me the whole time lol but I was here for it all. The stalker part was yum 😋\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTheir romance was so fucking sweet but Sante still kept that hardness about him when it came to mafia/violent matters which made all the difference. The way he dotes on her from the start 🫦🫦🫦 \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI like that Amelie’s profession was given a space in the story and not just a prop used to make her sound interesting. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis read like a really developed standalone even though I know it’s a spin off from a previous series. It did spoil stuff from books of the other series but I’m not deterred, I’ll still be reading the others written in this universe.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis was exactly what I was looking for to get me out of a slump and I’m soooo happy I read it, I’ve just discovered a new favourite author — watch me devour her backlist 😝🤭","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A30Y6WVV99CRYU\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgsTQ4rbjDYcitpA\"}}"},"likeCount":58,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":8},"User:117477137":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":117477137,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1676507365i/117477137._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":13,"textReviewsCount":797,"name":"Paige","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/117477137-paige","contributor":null,"id":117477137},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1M4BHIRLW90W3":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1M4BHIRLW90W3"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1M4BHIRLW90W3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1M4BHIRLW90W3","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1M4BHIRLW90W3"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/117477137?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7099307561"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.bcNVjI3p6aD6RBQdfoFptw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.bcNVjI3p6aD6RBQdfoFptw","creator":{"__ref":"User:117477137"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1779023512381,"createdAt":1735435882514,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1735436846828,"text":"This was more of 3.5 for me. I wanted to love this book so much but ultimately there were too many things I wasn’t a fan of. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eStarting off I had no idea this was a spin off of the Byrne brothers series. While this says it’s a standalone I very much felt out of the loop because I only read the first book in the original series. That book is where we meet Sante for the first time where he’s a 17 yr old asshole kid who does everything his psycho dad says. This book is about 4-5 years later. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe main thing I liked about this book was Sante. I loved his obsessiveness and how possessive he was. He was all about Amelie and we love that in a MMC but this leads to things I did not like about this book. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSante is so obsessed with Amelie for years. Four years to be exact, since time they spent together at her sisters wedding. He can’t stop thinking about her over the years, can’t help but want her, holds on to the ring he gives her and even gets it tattooed on him. All of this and yet he becomes an expert at sex because he slept his way through Sicily!! So you have thought about this girl nonstop for years and yet you decide to have tons of sex with other people instead of waiting for her? If you’re going to have your MMC obsessed with the FMC keeping him celibate makes that obsession 1000% better!! Not him screwing his way around Italy while the FMC HAS NEVER EVEN HAD AN ORGASM IN HER WHOLE LIFE? He’s all like omg I’m so glad I’m your first and I’m like yeah dude would have been nice if she was yours too don’t you think? Also if you’re super possessive you don’t let other women touch you. I don’t care if you’re trying to be polite. A real obsessed man will snatch a girls hand off him so fast!! Ugh. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlso I wasn’t a fan of Amelie!! I hate that I didn’t like her very much but she annoyed the crap out of me. Her thoughts were so conflicting and she kept everything to herself. Even knowing telling Sante would keep her safe she still wouldn’t say anything and it was so frustrating!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe resolution to the conflict was pretty anticlimactic and that whole thing about Sante’s half brother was really pointless. It added nothing to the book and I was just like who cares?!!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlso by 60% I’m was ready to wrap this thing up, it got kind of boring. I was just glad it wasn’t riddled with sex scenes. The first one isn’t until after 80%.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe more I write this review the more I think I need to change my rating to 3 stars instead. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI might read the next one cause Tommy intrigued me but i feel like I need to read the whole Byrne brother series to fully understand what’s going on. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNO CHEATING\u003cbr /\u003eLIGHT OW/OM DRAMA\u003cbr /\u003eKIND OF BREAK UP BUT MORE OF A MISUNDERSTANDING \u003cbr /\u003ePAST SA\u003cbr /\u003eVERY MAFIA LIGHT\u003cbr /\u003eHEA (married)","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1M4BHIRL