en silent for a while. My stare jumps back to his. He’s watching me, eyes brimming with curiosity and desire. ‘You sure you’ve had sex before?’”\u003cbr /\u003e💭 Im sorry this took me out \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“‘What are you up to?’ \u003cbr /\u003e‘Surprise,’ Lina says, holding up the pregnancy test with a mystified half smile. The entire room turns to Oran. He blinks twice before an enormous grin splits his face. \u003cbr /\u003e‘Hell, yeah! We’re having a baby!’”\u003cbr /\u003e💭 What am I reading 😭 it’s giving Wattpad\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/label\u003e","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A32J8A2MBU0LD9\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":10,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:32021365":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":32021365,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1681818508i/32021365._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":358,"textReviewsCount":1532,"name":"AvidReader","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/32021365-avidreader","contributor":null,"id":32021365},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1BC1G2UEHYN9X":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1BC1G2UEHYN9X"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1BC1G2UEHYN9X\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1BC1G2UEHYN9X","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1BC1G2UEHYN9X"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/32021365?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7081790478"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pMugqHczHBbh3CV-jU5CAg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.pMugqHczHBbh3CV-jU5CAg","creator":{"__ref":"User:32021365"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1756400446550,"createdAt":1735793443058,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1756392131916,"text":"If you love a good mafia romance with obsessed, stalkerish, morally grey hero and lovely ballerina heroine who is so strong despite all the sufferings, then this book is for you. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSante and Amelie meets one night and they bond over the hidden pain and past trauma. That makes a lasting impression on Sante so when he can’t forget her even after 4 years, he decides to see her once more. This time from the shadows. Man, wasn’t that the best decision of both their life. \u003cbr /\u003eI loved how protective and obsessed he was. Meanwhile Amelie gave him the peace and courage to face his own demons. \u003cbr /\u003eThere was a twist I never saw coming and I was happy to know what ‘really’ happened between Sante and Amelie on Oran’s wedding.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSo glad to see the gang Oran, Lina, Noemi, Conner and their beautiful kids.\u003cbr /\u003eI am so stoked to read Tommy’s book and that ending was everything. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSafety: It’s not mentioned but from what I understood Sante wasn’t celibate during that 4 years. That kinda bothered me because of how obsessed he was of her. Amelie too had short relationships. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e-Stalker romance. \u003cbr /\u003e-Obsessed hero x ballerina heroine. \u003cbr /\u003e-Anti hero.\u003cbr /\u003e-KU, TW could be read as a standalone.\u003cbr /\u003e-Recommend. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI received an advance review copy and I’m leaving this review voluntarily.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"c