:"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A34EVJ31U10IOB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A34EVJ31U10IOB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A34EVJ31U10IOB","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A34EVJ31U10IOB"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/184861090?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8370701831"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5Ci3-fgs_xAml8bOKCmggw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.5Ci3-fgs_xAml8bOKCmggw","creator":{"__ref":"User:184861090"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1772363413280,"createdAt":1772169048954,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1772169156775,"text":"3.5 🌟\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e'I’m as helpless as a butterfly trapped in a jar. If the jar was in his hands, would he release me or pluck off my wings as a souvenir? Release doesn’t seem an option for a man like him.' (Ch 9)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDevil's Thirst\u003cbr /\u003e(The Moretti Men Book 1)\u003cbr /\u003eBy Jill Ramsower\u003cbr /\u003eNarrated by Brooke Daniels \u0026amp; Peter Alden\u003cbr /\u003e9 hrs 12 mins / 335 Pages\u003cbr /\u003eALC/ebook Review\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLite Dark Stalker Romance | Mafia Romance | Morally Grey | Touch Her and 💀\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e'Fight or flight— at least those show a person is trying to avoid harm. Then there’s the freeze instinct.' (Ch 13)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWas hooked and enthralled with the story. (Except the part where MMC is a hypocrite, ugh. Like, dude, don't you think all of that crap sounds very eerily familiar to what you have done to Amelie... Yet, he never does realize it.)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e'Nothing about this city is normal, and that’s what makes it epic. Maybe one day the fears will no longer haunt me, and I’ll be epic, too.' (Ch 1)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFor all the trauma that Amelie went through in the past, she took everything rather well. Perhaps too well. I also didn't wholly buy into the MMC's reasoning behind the things he did to work his way into her life either. But it worked out for them.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e'He’s also domineering, possessive, and a tiny bit unhinged.\u003cbr /\u003e....\u003cbr /\u003eYeah, but I have my own fun little quirks as well.' (Ch 31)\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eFor the ALC, I liked the narrators. Just really prefer not to have the female narrator speak the male parts and the male narrator speak the female parts. For me, personally, it kind of dampened the setting or mood. Also, their pronunciations of Italian words and names were a little cringe. Other than that, it was good.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eALC/ebook courtesy of Hambright PR | Jill Ramsower LLC","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A34EVJ31U10IOB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":4,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:59566703":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":59566703,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1702514242i/59566703._UY200_CR2,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":109,"textReviewsCount":1126,"name":"Katie Murphy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/59566703-katie-murphy","contributor":null,"id":59566703},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A79Z1R40S0TAU":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A79Z1R40S0TAU"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A79Z1R40S0TAU\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A79Z1R40S0TAU","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A79Z1R40S0TAU"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/59566703?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7081756387"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.1Pi-EPyqtSlCM4RTKr3F7A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.1Pi-EPyqtSlCM4RTKr3F7A","creator":{"__ref":"User:59566703"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1740522935832,"createdAt":1734356309083,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1734357626282,"text":"✨ARC Review✨\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLet me start by start by saying that Jill absolutely knocked it out of the park with Sante and Amelie’s story. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNow, you don’t need to read any previous books to understand Sante and Amelie’s story but I would definitely recommend that you read the Byrne Brothers series as our Amelie our FMC is the sister of Lina from Vicious Seduction, and our MMC, Sante, is the brother of Noemi from Silent Vows and the cousin of Renzo from Craving Chaos. In addition to this many of the Byrne family make cameos in this book, which I highly enjoyed.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNow back to Devils Thirst.. Sante has just returned home from Italy where he has spent the last four years with his uncle Lazaro. Now his visit was only meant to be a short one until he laid eyes once again on Amelie👀 Two weeks later and the man was still here and his realisation was clear as day that he was beyond obsessed and would do everything and anything to ensure she became his.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e“I can be relentless when it comes to getting what I want. And I don’t just want Amelie Brooks; I’ll go fucking insane without her.” - yep that quote absolutely seals it for me👏🏼\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAmelie, is ballet dancer who is working hard practicing for the opening night of a new production and she starts to notice fairly quickly that she is being watched. As well as this Amelie gets a new neighbour who inserts himself into her life very quickly. Isaac is mysterious, protective of Amelie and very vague about his past which understandably Amelie wants to know about him. She soon realises at a Byrne family dinner that “Isaac” is in fact Sante Isaaco Manici. Poor Amelie had an awful shock, but Sante revealed to his family that he was home and home for good because he wanted Amelie in his life.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSante and Amelie’s chemistry is absolutely off the charts. Sante was always patient with Amelie, and absolutely worshipped the ground she walked on. Their journey was not easy as both of these characters had their demons, which they both worked through in this book with the support of one another and their families. You can definitely say that these beautiful souls found a light in one another in a sea of darkness🫶🏼\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe twists and turns of this book had my head absolutely spinning, I just loved that I couldn’t predict where the author was gonna take us next. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI am so excited for more that is to come in this series✨\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you so much to the author and Valentine PR for this e-arc for my honest thoughts 💭 ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A79Z1R40S0TAU\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":4,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:5878170":