"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:34885880":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":34885880,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1751697429i/34885880._UX200_CR0,33,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":96,"textReviewsCount":221,"name":"Anna (Literaria Luminaria)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/34885880-anna-literaria-luminaria","contributor":null,"id":34885880},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8RIBZJBJX87":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8RIBZJBJX87"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.DjTqi8B3yv5ZvD5R":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.DjTqi8B3yv5ZvD5R"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8RIBZJBJX87\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.DjTqi8B3yv5ZvD5R\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8RIBZJBJX87","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8RIBZJBJX87"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.DjTqi8B3yv5ZvD5R","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.DjTqi8B3yv5ZvD5R"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/34885880?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7728198270"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.0cnA_VNxw8zssrepflnEpg":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.0cnA_VNxw8zssrepflnEpg","creator":{"__ref":"User:34885880"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1756625777327,"createdAt":1752484565405,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1753129559507,"text":"I wanted to like this more than I did.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eDevil’s Thirst\u003c/i\u003e by Jill Ramsower has the bones of a great dark romance—Italian/Irish mafia, alpha anti-hero, the whole “good girl meets dangerous man” thing. But it didn’t quite land for me.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSante, the MMC, has been obsessed with Amelia for years after one brief meeting—and I do mean obsessed. He stalks her, inserts himself into her life without consent, and calls it love. And while I don’t mind a possessive hero in dark romance, the obsession here didn’t feel earned. Their original encounter was sweet, sure, but not world-altering enough to justify the level of fixation that follows. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt also didn’t help that while he’s supposedly spent years consumed by his feelings for Amelie, that didn’t stop him from sleeping his way through Italy in the meantime. It made his whole “you’re mine” vibe feel hollow. And the way the story handles Amelie’s sexual inexperience—specifically her never having had an orgasm until him—felt like a tired trope that wasn’t even executed believably. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThat said, Sante \u003ci\u003edoes\u003c/i\u003e care about her. Deeply. He would probably burn the world down for her. Unfortunately, Amelie gives him almost \u003ci\u003enothing\u003c/i\u003e in return. On top of that, she spends most of the book flipping back and forth on what she wants, making impulsive and sometimes dangerously \u003ci\u003edumb\u003c/i\u003e decisions. I kept waiting for her to grow, to show some emotional depth or agency, but it never really came.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ePlot-wise, it had potential, and I was definitely more interested in the wider world and side characters than the central romance. But I also felt like I’d walked into the middle of a story. Even though this is technically a standalone, there’s clearly an overlap with Ramsower’s other series, and it shows. A lot goes unexplained or is glossed over quickly (or the \u003ci\u003eopposite\u003c/i\u003e in that certain points are repeatedly made over and over again), and I found myself wishing I’d read her earlier books just to get a better grasp on the dynamics.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eStill, the book is readable. It’s a quick read, and the setup for the next installment was just intriguing enough that I’ll likely keep going. But as a standalone, this was surprisingly lukewarm for a story that markets itself as dark and all-consuming.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eTL;DR:\u003c/b\u003e Potentially hot in theory. Red flags in practice. Readable, but underwhelming. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThanks to IngramSpark for the free copy for review.","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1H8RIBZJBJX87\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.DjTqi8B3yv5ZvD5R\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:156470075":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":156470075,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1712068465i/156470075._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":23,"textReviewsCount":668,"name":"Aly","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/156470075-aly","contributor":null,"id":156470075},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3OIC4E9FNROJ3":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3OIC4E9FNROJ3"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3OIC4E9FNROJ3\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3OIC4E9FNROJ3","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3OIC4E9FNROJ3"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/156470075?shelf=read"},"taggings