d":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.2uLwZ1xNHyxagau54rrPjA","creator":{"__ref":"User:181116284"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1770975994557,"createdAt":1770953616630,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1770954662013,"text":"I am a sucker for mafia romance and this book delivered! This has so much potential. I liked the plot line. I felt like there was a good amount of story to smut. But there were times when I was getting bored and waiting to Amelie to finally start making sense. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved how Sante was so possessive and obsessed with Amelie to the point of stalking her for weeks. It sounds messed up but I liked it. LOL he literally stalks her to protect her. I liked how he was so intuitive to Amelie’s feelings and actions. He knew what she needed before she even said anything. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI didn’t like how Amelie was keeping all these secrets thinking she couldn’t do anything. Like the only way to protect her and her family was to stay quiet?? She has so many ties to the Irish mafia, the Italian mafia, and the Russian mafia!! All her friends and family are in the mafia!! You’re telling me you couldn’t ask them for help??? Her brother-in-law literally took out The Society that kidnapped her when she was younger and you couldn’t ask him to help you take down this one guy???? It just made no sense to me. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAlso what was with the revelation about Umberto?? That secret literally did nothing for the storyline. It was seriously pointless. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhile this is the first book in the series and the first I’ve read from the author, I realized as I was reading the this is an interconnected series with the Byrne brothers series. You can read it as a standalone but I feel like you should read the Byrne brothers series first. There were times where I was lost and confused because I didn’t have the back story. Like the whole thing with The Society. They were mentioned a few times but I don’t even know what they actually were. And they play a big part in Amelie’s past. \u003cbr /\u003e","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1DOPZPDNY36LO\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:158903258":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":158903258,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1784281057i/158903258._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":56,"textReviewsCount":571,"name":"Isabella Grace","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/158903258-isabella-grace","contributor":null,"id":158903258},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A15F6EJUV12RSU":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A15F6EJUV12RSU"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A15F6EJUV12RSU\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A15F6EJUV12RSU","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A15F6EJUV12RSU"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/158903258?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7749944849"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.OvmGifh07JfOKpUf_t5PsQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.OvmGifh07JfOKpUf_t5PsQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:158903258"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1753259614241,"createdAt":1752859744348,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1752879300180,"text":"I was so so so excited about this book when I read the tropes. But it just didn’t come together the way I hoped and that made me sad because I truly love Jill Ramsowers writing and books. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn this book we have Sante, our MMC and Amelie, our FMC. They meet at her sisters wedding and sparks fly. But they are both very young…working through serious issues and trauma. And before anything can come of them, Sante is sent to Sicily for 4 years. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhen he comes back, Amelie is deep into her ballet career and Sante is OTT obsessed with her. To the point that he moves in next door to her she starts to stalk her. She doesn’t even realise it’s him because he’s changed so much in the 4 years he’s been gone. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI’ve seen people having issues with the fact that he wasn’t celibate the 4 years he was gone…it wasn’t a big deal. They never had relationship before he left so really even though he had feelings for he the whole time, he was under no obligation to be faithful. It just is what it is. What did bother be was his aggression when it came to $£x. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSante had so many moments of sincerity and caring that truly made my heart melt. But at the same time he was so aggressive when it came to getting her in bed. It felt like that was all he cared about. It just gave me the ick. Because it wasn’t a thing where they were both feeling it. It was 1000000% one sided. She had feelings for him but was still trying to get to know him and he just wanted to get to know her insides 😩😩😩\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe first half of the book was OK…but the second half felt like a literal time warp. We zoomed so fast through things that I had no idea what was happening. I thought I was missing pages. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis one wasn’t a hit for me. But it might be for you so if this is up your alley definitely give it a shot ❤️\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you so much to Jill Ramsower and Valentine PR for the opportunity to ARC read this book ❤️","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A15F6EJUV12RSU\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:189160188":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":189160188,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1743554668i/189160188._UX200_CR0,22,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":30,"textReviewsCount":115,"name":"Rachel","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/189160188-rachel","contributor":null,"id":189160188},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A6Z707OUDZDMA":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A6Z707OUDZDMA"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A6Z707OUDZDMA\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A6Z707OUDZDMA","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A6Z707OUDZDMA"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/189160188?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7474073802"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.G7Ty5B6oHLr6YRiK-hi5Hw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.G7Ty5B6oHLr6YRiK-hi5Hw","creator":{"__ref":"User:189160188"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1771192525221,"createdAt":1771102292446,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1771103223914,"text":"I received the ALC for this book from Hambright pr and this is my honest review.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTo start this book is the definition of \"He falls first..and hard\". The MMC Sante had all the alpha anti-hero Italian vibes with his soft side for his one and only FMC Amelie. I loved the ballerina/mafia style this book brought. While it did have a slow start feeling as if it was dragging out and was difficult in the beginning to emotionally connect with the characters, I did enjoy the satisfying ending and character growth of both the MCs. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBrook Daniels did a phenomenal job of narrating the female POV of the book. When she had to read the MMC lines I didn't feel a change or awkwardness like with some audible narrators. I could really hear the emotions in the character and her lines were read with palpable feelings. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003ePeter Aiden did a wonderful job narrating the MMC as well. He really gave that gravel voice a deep sense of yearning that character had and I was 100% here for it. I will say when he read the FMC during his POV it was a bit awkward for me but that could be because I don't listen to audio books very often. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOverall I would say I did enjoy this book and if you're looking for a quick read that scratches that insta love/mafia vibes I would suggest this book. ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A6Z707OUDZDMA\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:120347882":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":120347882,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1704138399i/120347882._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":219,"textReviewsCount":1478,"name":"Amber (Amber Reads Romance)","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/120347882-amber-amber-reads-romance","contributor":null,"id":120347882},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EVP3BPRKL5G7":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EVP3BPRKL5G7"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EVP3BPRKL5G7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2EVP3BPRKL5G7","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EVP3BPRKL5G7"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/120347882?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2025-arc","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/120347882?shelf=2025-arc"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"audiobook","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/120347882?shelf=audiobook"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"ballerina","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/120347882?shelf=ballerina"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"boy-obsessed","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/120347882?shelf=boy-obsessed"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"stalker","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/120347882?shelf=stalker"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7242480223"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.nsijxvzwqlqMv5BwPbN1hA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.nsijxvzwqlqMv5BwPbN1hA","creator":{"__ref":"User:120347882"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1738128577936,"createdAt":1737677431666,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1737913780565,"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐\u003cbr /\u003e🌶️🌶️.5\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eDevil's Thirst is the first book in The Moretti Men series, but I honestly feel like you need to read the previous series to fully connect with this book. I felt like I was missing a lot from the character's backstories because they were covered in the Byrne Brothers. I still enjoyed this romance, but I would have probably loved it if I read the other series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSante has been obsessed with Amelie since he met her at a wedding four years ago. He has returned home after being sent away to finally make Amelie his woman. He may go about it in some crazy ways by stalking, hiding his identity, and moving into her neighbors' place. However, he did it in a sweet and protective way. Amelie has a complicated past and is hiding a big secret about the man who tried to buy her virginity. Her life could be in danger, but Sante is determined to keep her safe. I really liked that she didn't freak out and end things with him when she discovers who he really was and what he did to get her. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI loved Sante's character and how protective/obsessive he was of Amelie. He was so patient with her and took things slowly in the bedroom due to her previous traumas. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e🎧 Audiobook Review 🎧\u003cbr /\u003ePeter Alden and Brooke Daniels narrated the audiobook, and I thought they both did a great job bringing the banter, suspense, and spice to their performances.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you to Valentine PR for providing the ALC.","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2EVP3BPRKL5G7\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":2,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:172800854":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":172800854,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1735797870i/172800854._UX200_CR0,11,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":205,"textReviewsCount":552,"name":"destiny","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/172800854-destiny","contributor":null,"id":172800854},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2HX32WDQWSEL1":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2HX32WDQWSEL1"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2HX32WDQWSEL1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2HX32WDQWSEL1","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2HX32WDQWSEL1"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/172800854?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7143009744"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.yGi2Zzrk__-XoC9C5VaRZw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.yGi2Zzrk__-XoC9C5VaRZw","creator":{"__ref":"User:172800854"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1739394856194,"createdAt":1739384517573,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1739385069654,"text":"i feel manipulated and mind fucked \u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003ekind of lost interest mid way but i’m glad i pushed through though !! i heard about this on tiktok and i love a good mafia stalker romance. this was definitely more focused on the main characters and the plot was sort of lost at some point. \u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003edark romance, mafia stalker mmc, ballerina fmc, praise, “pet”, light bondage, sexual assault, “my wife”, and dual pov 🖤\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003ealthough sante’s past wasn’t fully revealed, amelie goes through some rough shit. her parents sold her virginity to a well known man. ever since then amelie ran away. tbh there wasn’t much mafia until towards the end. so idk if i would really call this a mafia romance. it does have mafia ties though.\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003ei definitely want to try to continue this series because i think it has such great potential. i just feel like this was a lowkey miss :/ \u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003e🌶️🌶️","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2HX32WDQWSEL1\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}"},"likeCount":3,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:8356898":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":8356898,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1754664971i/8356898._UY200_CR15,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":36,"textReviewsCount":742,"name":"Misty • booksplusplants","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/8356898-misty-booksplusplants","contributor":null,"id":8356898},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ASFT1Z5AOL48E":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ASFT1Z5AOL48E"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/ASFT1Z5AOL48E\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/ASFT1Z5AOL48E","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/ASFT1Z5AOL48E"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.rMUquUqxpWpmTijz"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/8356898?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/7714511777"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DamjShupL6-ZNFEMuwo2qA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.DamjShupL6-ZNFEMuwo2qA","creator":{"__ref":"User:8356898"},"recommendFor":null,"upd